sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Transaction Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant K as Kafka
  participant Fraud as Fraud Service
  User->>UI: cria transação
  UI->>API: POST + Idempotency-Key
  API->>DB: transaction + outbox no mesmo commit
  API-->>UI: 201 PENDING
  API->>K: transaction.created.v1
  K->>Fraud: entrega evento
  Fraud->>Fraud: valida, deduplica e analisa
  Fraud->>K: fraud.analysis.completed.v1
  K->>API: resultado + correlation ID
  API->>DB: análise + status + histórico
  UI->>API: consulta detalhes
  API-->>UI: score, reasons e timeline
  User->>UI: decide review
  UI->>API: POST review
  API->>DB: review + auditoria + status final
